<figure class="atlas-timescales">
	<div
		class="diagram"
		role="img"
		aria-label="Two nested generation processes in Atlas. Across the sequence, the model uses earlier posed frames to predict one new element at a time. Within each new image or depth element, rectified flow gradually transforms noise into the requested output."
	>
		<header class="diagram-header">
			<p class="eyebrow">A conceptual view</p>
			<h3>Two generation timescales</h3>
		</header>

		<section class="outer-process" aria-label="Autoregression across sequence elements">
			<div class="process-label">
				<span>Across the sequence</span>
				<strong>One element at a time</strong>
			</div>

			<div class="sequence">
				<div class="element context-element">
					<span class="element-type">Context</span>
					<strong>Pose₁ + RGB₁</strong>
				</div>
				<span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
				<div class="element context-element">
					<span class="element-type">Context</span>
					<strong>Pose₂ + RGB₂</strong>
				</div>
				<span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
				<div class="element request-element">
					<span class="element-type">Request</span>
					<strong>Target pose</strong>
				</div>
				<span class="arrow active-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
				<div class="element target-element">
					<span class="element-type">Next element</span>
					<strong>RGB or depth</strong>
				</div>
				<span class="continuation" aria-hidden="true">···</span>
			</div>
		</section>

		<div class="connector" aria-hidden="true"><span></span></div>

		<section class="inner-process" aria-label="Rectified flow within one continuous element">
			<div class="process-label">
				<span>Within the next element</span>
				<strong>The whole output is refined together</strong>
			</div>

			<div class="denoising-flow">
				<div class="latent noise">
					<span class="latent-preview" aria-hidden="true"></span>
					<p><strong>Noise</strong><small>Starting latent</small></p>
				</div>
				<div class="flow-step" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><small>Rectified flow</small></div>
				<div class="latent forming">
					<span class="latent-preview" aria-hidden="true"></span>
					<p><strong>Structure emerges</strong><small>Iterative refinement</small></p>
				</div>
				<div class="flow-step" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><small>More steps</small></div>
				<div class="latent resolved">
					<span class="latent-preview" aria-hidden="true"></span>
					<p><strong>RGB or depth</strong><small>Complete element</small></p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<p class="takeaway"><strong>Autoregression carries world state forward.</strong> Rectified flow synthesizes each complete image or depth element.</p>
	</div>
	<figcaption>
		A conceptual reading of Atlas' public description. It separates sequence order from within element denoising; it is not an official implementation diagram.
	</figcaption>
</figure>

